'''Thunderblood Knucklechains''' are a version of [[Nord Knucklechains]] upgraded with [[Thunderblood Essence]]. They gain extra [[blunt]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* The primary attack is a 2-hit combo with 2x damage at the second hit.
* The secondary attack is a kick which does additional knockback and 6x [[staggering]].
* They deal 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

Upgraded Nord Knucklechains will '''NOT''' keep their upgrade level when they are crafted into Thunderblood Knucklechains.

